1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
<i>[Music]</i>

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,800
{\an8}This is the story of a store
that sold everything for the house.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,400
It began with two men and
a very bad Friday.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,000
They had been fired that morning.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,900
By lunch they were already
planning something bigger.

6
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:21,500
The idea was simple: stack it high,

7
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,800
sell it cheap, and teach people
how to use it.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,400
Nobody believed it would work.

9
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:32,000
Their first stores were
cavernous &amp; nearly empty.

10
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:36,100
But the contractors came back,
and then they brought friends.

11
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:40,000
Within a decade the company was
opening a store every week.
